        {"zh": "你退到哪我都能看到", "en": "I can see wherever you retreat."},
        {"zh": "我从不主动，但这次例外", "en": "I never start, but this is an exception."},
        {"zh": "你还有三秒", "en": "You have three seconds."},
        {"zh": "我会一直盯着你", "en": "I will keep my eyes on you."}
